A||||3||mshill||One funky electrical problem...||||1||
Z||000000||mshill||08-09-2000||12:31 AM||||I already fixed this problem, but I thought it strange what the symptoms were.  <P>After intalling 120mph speedo and replacing some of the backlighting in the guage cluster (I now have a SHIFT light and think it is really annoying) my radio would shut off when the ignition was on and the door was opened.  Also, the fuse box and passenger side courtesy lights would not go on.  Additionally, when the door was open and the horn botton is pressed, the courtesy lights would flicker.<P>Come to find out, while I was messing around the dash I shorted something and caused the BATT fuse to blow.  I would have thought that the radio would not come on at all if the BATT fuse was blown.||||reg||1
